OS Platform and Distribution (e.g., Linux Ubuntu 16.04): Windows 10

ONNX Runtime installed from (source or binary): [https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/releases](https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/releases)

ONNX Runtime version: 1.8.1

Visual Studio version (if applicable):16.10.4

GCC/Compiler version (if compiling from source): NA

CUDA/cuDNN version: cuda\_11.0.3 / cudnn-11.0-windows-x64-v8.0.2.39

GPU model and memory: GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop

