0xC0000005 means one or more arguments you are trying to use is invalid. I suspect is is the model path. The debugger should should you better than my guess. You do not have new Ort::Session so you do not need to delete it. You can just instantiate it on the stack.

Also try to catch the exceptions in main() and print a meaningful message in case a C++ exception is throw, instead of just terminating.

